{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12690","headline":"漫问相里黄州 · 元结","name":"漫问相里黄州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东邻有渔父，西邻有山僧。\n各问其性情，变之俱不能。\n公爲二千石，我爲山海客。\n志业岂不同，今已殊名迹。\n相里不相类，相友且相异。\n何况天下人，而欲同其意。\n人意苟不同，分寸不相容。\n漫问轩裳客，何如耕钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}